# guard-plug: the player's own bodies on guard and attack orders plug a corridor 8 cells wide from wall to wall;
# six bodies are sent through each on a move order at tick 100.
#   A  the plug PG guards a still body W of its own behind it
#   B  the plug PA is on an attack order on an enemy body T it cannot destroy within the run (in reach, firing)
#   C  the plug PF is on an attack-move order and stands firing at T2 (an attack ahead of its leg)
# A body on an attack or guard leg is its owner's to end and reads as live, so the bodies waiting behind it keep
# their orders for as long as it stands there: behind a firing line that is what the player wants (the army goes on
# when the target is destroyed, siege-gap.scn). Read as bodies without progress (the bodies of PF and PG have no
# Legion member: combat and the guard hold them where they stand from the first tick), they ended the orders behind
# them at 4,800 dead ticks: five of C's six and two of A's by tick 9,000. The guards of A are the open case: beside
# a ward that never moves they will not move again either, and the six behind them wait for good, as before the
# rules (docs/legion-pathfinding.md, "Known weaknesses"; Retail ends all eighteen orders).
# Keys: g.B.complete_n, g.C.complete_n (0: the orders behind a firing line are kept), g.A.complete_n (0 as well,
# reported, not bounded).
scn 1
name guard-plug
ticks 9000
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
wanderers off
map flat 128 96
wall 34 0 60 16
wall 34 24 60 16
wall 34 48 60 16
wall 34 72 60 24
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
type g mover 2 2500 10 1.79999 gun=64,1,1.0
type tgt mover 2 2500 10 1.8 hp=900000
group W 0 m 1 cells 66,19
group PG 0 m 4 cells 61,17 61,19 61,21 61,23
group T 1 tgt 1 cells 66,43 weapons=off
group PA 0 g 4 cells 61,41 61,43 61,45 61,47 weapons=on
group T2 1 tgt 1 cells 66,67 weapons=off
group PF 0 g 4 cells 61,65 61,67 61,69 61,71 weapons=on
group A 0 m 6 rect 4 14 12 26 pitch=3
group B 0 m 6 rect 4 38 12 50 pitch=3
group C 0 m 6 rect 4 62 12 74 pitch=3
at 2 guard PG @W
at 2 attack PA @T
at 2 fight PF 112 68
at 100 move A 112 20
at 100 move B 112 44
at 100 move C 112 68
